ase randomly output one of \"[[A]]\", \"[[B]]\", \"[[C]]\", or \"[[D]]\";\n(3) Please only output the most likely answer index based on the given information, and do not output any other content.\n\n[Story]\nMrs. Wu's son, Xiao Gang, is very smart, he has plenty of food and clothing since he is a child, and his parents protect him very well. Now he gets admitted to the university he always dreams of. This university is very famous, and Xiao Gang is the first child in the family to enter such a high-level university. Mrs. Wu and her family feel extremely excited about this news.\n\n[Question]\nMrs. Wu should be excited about her son being admitted to his favorite university, but why does she actually seem worried?\n\n[Candidate Answers]\nA. Mrs. Wu worries that Xiao Gang's admission to such a good university may cause jealousy and dissatisfaction among other family members.\nB. Mrs. Wu worries that Xiao Gang may not adapt to the outside environment when he leaves home.\nC. Mrs. Wu worries that Xiao Gang may face many challenges in his university studies.\nD. Mrs. Wu worries that Xiao Gang's success may make his relationship with his family distant.","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":2,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.0019266471902873617,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af3e10cd6006945d27fe14a","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794367756989,"createTime":"2026-11-11 11:29:16","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null}],"first":true,"last":true},"nonce":"122e070c7baf48998fc0811302579794"}